{"ID":"20240515131439-5q4wi7p","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131439-5q4wi7p","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131439-5q4wi7p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133546-j1gzk11\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133546-j1gzk11\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:90,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133546-j1gzk11\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:233,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:233\u0026#125;","title":"025","type":"doc","updated":"20240515152944"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515133546-j1gzk11","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 825px;","id":"20240515133546-j1gzk11","updated":"20240515152944"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2006/09/07"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Coulter, John"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"約四十歲 , 身壯"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/27"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胰臟癌複診"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 睡眠好 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 左肋痛去"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 小便淡黃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 雙足仍有冷"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 胃口好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 大便每日行"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 口渴正常"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. 睡時無寒熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9. 體力尚好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"稍洪大有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃白乾厚→燥熱，寒熱並結"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人進步中"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同8/12 方, 改砲附子六錢  麥冬三錢  天花三錢  黨參三錢  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9碗煮成三碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各服一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 治胰臟癌一定要注意大便"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 左側肋下持續痛是胰臟癌 , 偶爾會痛是胰臟炎."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 舌: 黃白—寒熱並結 , 乾—津液燥 , 厚—燥區大"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 天花可增加血中的津液,  麥冬增潤肺的津液,  黨參增加腸胃津液"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 病人右臉下方稍腫大,  師觸診後告知,  因無腫塊又無熱,  無須擔憂."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}